  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 6.42,
      "e": 12.42,
      "text": "It is my number one goal to organize a high quality experience for the lowest price possible."
    },
    {
      "s": 12.42,
      "e": 14.42,
      "text": "Thank you, Valen! Keep Valen!"
    },
    {
      "s": 14.42,
      "e": 16.42,
      "text": "Of course, it's phenomenal. I learned a lot."
    },
    {
      "s": 16.42,
      "e": 18.42,
      "text": "Swiftwater rescue and survival."
    },
    {
      "s": 18.42,
      "e": 23.42,
      "text": "It's a very important life skill, at least for what I'd like to do with life."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.42,
      "e": 25.42,
      "text": "You're not prepared until you actually do it."
    },
    {
      "s": 25.42,
      "e": 28.42,
      "text": "Water was just coming over the top of us."
    },
    {
      "s": 28.42,
      "e": 32.42,
      "text": "Water was hitting our faces, coming over our helmets."
    },
    {
      "s": 32.42,
      "e": 33.42,
      "text": "I lost my footing."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.42,
      "e": 37.42,
      "text": "I held onto the paddle, and I fell right in."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.42,
      "e": 43.45,
      "text": "This trip was a huge success."
    },
    {
      "s": 43.45,
      "e": 50.45,
      "text": "I would definitely look at doing something again with the rescue project up here in tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.45,
      "e": 56.45,
      "text": "I'm already kind of in discussions with our instructors about how we can make that happen."
    }
  ],
